    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The \"p\" key is no longer required to toggle controller input functionality.
    As of right now controller controls can't be changed. This of course will be
    fixed. \nControls with gamepad: LEFT STICK to move, RIGHT STICK to rotate and
    shoot, A(XBOX) or X(PS) or LEFT BUMPER to switch weapons, RIGHT BUMPER to dash,
    X to use equipment, Y to interact with buttons. and START to pause\n\nLots of
    improvements and features in this version! There are definitely some bugs lying
    around but they shouldnt be gamebreaking to my knowledge.\nTHANKS FOR PLAYING
    KILLBOX!!"
