  m_Material: {fileID: 2100000, guid: d7c3a952d880d49bf9c207fa73dd92e0, type: 3}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: d7c3a952d880d49bf9c207fa73dd92e0, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 14
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 1
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 4
    m_AlignByGeometry: 1
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'V 0.2 Features to be added:

    - Audio will be upgraded to not just
    one soundtrack, and may remove this specific borrowed soundtrack.

    - More
    enemies will be introduced

    - An Easter Egg Weapon will be introduced, along
    with upgraded versions of current weapons.

    -Buyable speed will be new to
    the shop.

    - Equipment will be buyable in the shop. (Grenades, Helpful AI,
    and more.)

    - More maps will be introduced, and some will have teleporters
    to get around the map.

    - Items will be able to spawn in the game, and can
    be picked up. They can be weapons, tokens, health, speed, etc.

    -Multiplayer
    will exist, but not in 0.2...'
